@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
skinparam ArrowColor #CBD5E1
title Proposed coordinator knowledge state machine — not a universal product enum
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

state "Admitted / pending" as P
state "Claimed before known dispatch" as C
state "Dispatch possible / awaiting evidence" as D
state "Unknown effect" as U
state "Reconciling same attempt" as R
state "Observed terminal outcome\nconfirmed / partial / no-effect failure as applicable" as T
state "Confirmed prevented before dispatch" as X
[*] --> P : durable admission committed
P --> C : current atomic claim
P --> X : cancellation atomically prevents dispatch
C --> P : proven no dispatch + safe reclaim
C --> D : consequential dispatch admitted
D --> T : attributable terminal evidence
D --> U : response / worker lost; effect unresolved
U --> R : scoped reconciliation admitted
R --> U : evidence still insufficient
R --> T : actual terminal observation established
R --> P : proven no dispatch + source-permitted continuation
T --> [*]
X --> [*]
note bottom of T
 Cancellation intent, output availability and cleanup are separate dimensions.
 Terminal effect is not completed cleanup; a fresh retry is a new eligible attempt.
 State labels refine local knowledge, not source-defined workflow UI states.
end note
@enduml
